<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 1.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with an 7.50 pct coupon, and a fifth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 7.75 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		   Oct 1,1999	Pvs    Sept 15,2001    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.72 pct    6.15 pct    6.10 pct     6.38 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.67 pct    7.11 pct    7.09 pct     7.36 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 102.45	 101.35     103.15	  102.05</p>
<p> Bids	     4.43 trln lire	   3.37 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 1.50 trln lire	   2.00 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on Oct 16 of a third tranche of three and five-year Btps.</p>
</text>
